.IX Title "AMSBENCHS 1"
.TH AMSBENCHS 1 2025-11-26 "perl v5.38.2" "AMS executables"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH NAME
amsbenchs \- Asynchronous Message Service (AMS) benchmarking driver
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBamsbenchs\fR \fIcount\fR \fIsize\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBamsbenchs\fR is a test program that simply publishes \fIcount\fR messages of
\&\fIsize\fR bytes each on subject "bench", then waits while all published
messages are transmitted, terminating when the user uses ^C to interrupt
the program.  The remaining number of messages to be published in the test
is written into the first four octets of each message.
.PP
\&\fBamsbenchs\fR will register as an application module in the root unit of
the venture identified by application name "amsdemo" and authority name
"test".  A configuration server for the local continuum and a registrar
for the root unit of that venture (which may both be instantiated in a
single \fBamsd\fR daemon task) must be running in order for \fBamsbenchs\fR to
commence operations.
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.IX Header "EXIT STATUS"
.IP \-1 4
.IX Item "-1"
\&\fBamsbenchs\fR failed, for reasons noted in the ion.log file.
.IP """0""" 4
.IX Item """0"""
\&\fBamsbenchs\fR terminated normally.
.SH FILES
.IX Header "FILES"
A MIB initialization file with the applicable default name (see \fBamsrc\fR\|(5))
must be present.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.IX Header "ENVIRONMENT"
No environment variables apply.
.SH DIAGNOSTICS
.IX Header "DIAGNOSTICS"
The following diagnostics may be issued to the \fBion.log\fR log file:
.IP "No memory for amsbenchs." 4
.IX Item "No memory for amsbenchs."
Insufficient available memory for a message content buffer of the
indicated size.
.IP "amsbenchs can't register." 4
.IX Item "amsbenchs can't register."
\&\fBamsbenchs\fR failed to register, for reasons noted in the ion.log file.
.IP "amsbenchs can't set event manager." 4
.IX Item "amsbenchs can't set event manager."
\&\fBamsbenchs\fR failed to start its background event management thread, for
reasons noted in the ion.log file.
.IP "amsbenchs: subject 'bench' is unknown." 4
.IX Item "amsbenchs: subject 'bench' is unknown."
\&\fBamsbenchs\fR can't publish test messages; probably an error in the MIB
initialization file.
.IP "amsbenchs can't publish message." 4
.IX Item "amsbenchs can't publish message."
\&\fBamsbenchs\fR failed to publish, for reasons noted in the ion.log file.
.SH BUGS
.IX Header "BUGS"
Report bugs to <https://github.com/nasa\-jpl/ION\-DTN/issues>
